                "6f4c6b4e7cbc7401d47f2bd15f6bbaf2b85ac083"
            ],
            "ref": "refs/changes/25/82525/1",
            "uploader": {
                "name": "Jason Hsu",
                "email": "jason-hsu@quantatw.com",
                "username": "QuantaJasonHsu"
            },
            "createdOn": 1754358817,
            "author": {
                "name": "Jason Hsu",
                "email": "jason-hsu@quantatw.com",
                "username": "QuantaJasonHsu"
            },
            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "Please also provide a reverse config which will probe on these gpio presence entries. For illustration you can refer to https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/82528/1/configurations/meta/ventura_valve.json and define the VT Inventory items as board for now."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jason Hsu",
                        "email": "jason-hsu@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "QuantaJasonHsu"
                    },
                    "message": "May I ask specifically what needs to be added? What is currently missing in the patch 2? I would appreciate your detailed response."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "@jason-hsu@quantatw.com\n\nYou need to also add an EM Configuration which defines the VT inventory item. This configuration should probe on reverse interface (xyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Source.DevicePresence) exposed by gpio-presence daemon . You can refer to Ventura cables as an example https://github.com/openbmc/entity-manager/blob/master/configurations/meta/ventura_cable.json#L29 and [1] for design.\n\n\n\n[1] https://github.com/openbmc/docs/blob/master/designs/inventory/gpio-based-hardware-inventory.md"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eldin Lee",
                        "email": "eldin.lee@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "eldin-lee"
                    },
                    "message": "> @jason-hsu@quantatw.com\n> \n> You need to also add an EM Configuration which defines the VT inventory item. This configuration should probe on reverse interface (xyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Source.DevicePresence) exposed by gpio-presence daemon . You can refer to Ventura cables as an example https://github.com/openbmc/entity-manager/blob/master/configurations/meta/ventura_cable.json#L29 and [1] for design.\n> \n> \n> \n> [1] https://github.com/openbmc/docs/blob/master/designs/inventory/gpio-based-hardware-inventory.md\n\n@paligill@gmail.com Thanks for your suggestion. I\u2019ve updated [ventura_cable.json](https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/82525/5/configurations/meta/ventura_cable.json) to include the ReturnValve and SupplyValve. Could you please help us review this update?\n\n```bash\nbusctl tree xyz.openbmc_project.EntityManager \n\n        \u2514\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/cable\n          \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/cable/ReturnValve\n          \u2514\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/cable/SupplyValve\n```\n\n```bash\nbusctl introspect xyz.openbmc_project.EntityManager /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/cable/ReturnValve\n\nNAME                                          TYPE      SIGNATURE RESULT/VALUE\norg.freedesktop.DBus.Introspectable           interface -         -\n.Introspect                                   method    -         s\norg.freedesktop.DBus.Peer                     interface -         -\n.GetMachineId                                 method    -         s\n.Ping                                         method    -         -\norg.freedesktop.DBus.Properties               interface -         -\n.Get                                          method    ss        v\n.GetAll                                       method    s         a{sv}\n.Set                                          method    ssv       -\n.PropertiesChanged                            signal    sa{sv}as  -\nxyz.openbmc_project.AddObject                 interface -         -\n.AddObject                                    method    a{sv}     -\nxyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Decorator.Asset interface -         -\n.Manufacturer                                 property  s         \"Unknown\"\n.Model                                        property  s         \"Unknown\"\n.PartNumber                                   property  s         \"Unknown\"\n.SerialNumber                                 property  s         \"Unknown\"\n.SparePartNumber                              property  s         \"07-100975\"\nxyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Decorator.Cable interface -         -\n.Length                                       property  d         0.485\n.Type                                         property  s         \"Copper\"\nxyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Item.Cable      interface -         -\n.Name                                         property  s         \"ReturnValve\"\n.Probe                                        property  as        3 \"xyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Source\u2592\n.Type                                         property  s         \"Cable\"\n\n\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "@eldin.lee@quantatw.com\nFYI: In future we will also need to expose the VTs as Valves pair which is the work underway https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/77415. Probably we can use the same gpio-presence object (being exposed in this PR) for probing if there is no separate presence signal for that."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eldin Lee",
                        "email": "eldin.lee@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "eldin-lee"
                    },
                    "message": "Got it. For now, it seems we only have PRSNT_SUPPLY_N and PRSNT_RETURN_N, so reusing the gpio-presence object sounds reasonable. Thanks for sharing this information. Please let us know when this feature is implemented so we can stay aligned."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/ventura_scm.json",
                    "line": 489,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "Lets name this ReturnValve"
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/ventura_scm.json",
                    "line": 489,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jason Hsu",
                        "email": "jason-hsu@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "QuantaJasonHsu"
                    },
                    "message": "It has been renamed to ReturnValve."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/ventura_scm.json",
                    "line": 499,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "Lets name this SupplyValve"
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/ventura_scm.json",
                    "line": 499,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jason Hsu",
                        "email": "jason-hsu@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "QuantaJasonHsu"
                    },
                    "message": "It has been renamed to SupplyValve."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/ventura_scm.json",
                    "line": 509,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "We should only model the inventory presence for Supply and Return Valve Train via first 2 entries on line 489 and 499.\n\nRETURN_CNTL_FB_D_R and SUPPLY_CNTL_FB_D_R are open/close status which should be modeled for now via phosphor-gpio-monitor. I am in process of adding a valve-monitor upstream, once that is available the valve status will be moved to valve-monitor from phosphor-gpio-monitor.\n\nI am also in process of adding Valve events https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/77419, so after consensus/approval these can be raised from phosphor-gpio-monitor too."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/ventura_scm.json",
                    "line": 509,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jason Hsu",
                        "email": "jason-hsu@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "QuantaJasonHsu"
                    },
                    "message": "We will place RETURN_CNTL_FB_D_R and SUPPLY_CNTL_FB_D_R in phosphor-gpio-monitor for now. Once you\u2019ve finished adding valve-monitor, we\u2019ll move them over to valve-monitor, thank you."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/ventura_scm.json",
                    "line": 529,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "Is this RPU inventory or status? Looks like status to me, if yes, then it should be modeled via phosphor-gpio-monitor.\nAlso, if above is true we will need an event for this RPU status."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/ventura_scm.json",
                    "line": 529,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jason Hsu",
                        "email": "jason-hsu@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "QuantaJasonHsu"
                    },
                    "message": "It looks like phosphor-gpio-monitor is already present, so this part can be removed."
                }
            ],
