                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/ventura_cable.json",
                    "line": 240,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eldin Lee",
                        "email": "eldin.lee@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "eldin-lee"
                    },
                    "message": "Updated the FBPNs:\n07-100704 Turck 10-Pin Y-Splitter (Supply)\n07-100705 Turck 6-Pin Y-Splitter (Return)\n\nFrom the schematic, I see that each cable includes 6 pins (listed below), so it provides power too\n```shell\n#SUPPLY\nPRSNT_SUPPLY_N\nSUPPLY_CNTL_FB_N\nP24V_MOTOR_IN\nP24V_VALVE_CLOSE\nP24V_VALVE_OPEN\nGND\n\n#RETURN\nPRSNT_RETURN_N\nRETURN_CNTL_FB_N\nP24V_MOTOR_IN\nP24V_VALVE_CLOSE\nP24V_VALVE_OPEN\nGND\n```"
                }
